&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Make sure the that the `zeppelin-distribution` is build after the `geode` module. By default if you activate the geode profile (`-Pgeode`) the maven reactor will order the geode after the zeppelin-distribution. In result the geode is never added to the zeppelin binary distro.&lt;/li&gt;
